{'symbol': 'BXP', 'date': '2021-01-26 16:30:00', 'title': 'BOSTON PROPERTIES ANNOUNCES FOURTH QUARTER 2020 RESULTS; REPORTS EPS OF $0.05 AND FFO PER SHARE OF $1.37', 'text': 'BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BOSTON PROPERTIES, INC. (NYSE:BXP), THE LARGEST PUBLICLY-TRADED DEVELOPER, OWNER AND MANAGER OF CLASS A OFFICE PROPERTIES IN THE UNITED STATES, REPORTED RESULTS TODAY FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2020. FINANCIAL HIGHLIGHTS FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER INCLUDE: NET INCOME ATTRIBUTABLE TO COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF $7.3 MILLION, OR $0.05 PER DILUTED SHARE (EPS), COMPARED TO $140.8 MILLION, OR $0.91 PER DILUTED SHARE, FOR THE QUARTER ENDED DECEMBER 31, 201'}